cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this ontology in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "FRAM Ontology: An OWL 2 Vocabulary for the Functional Resonance Analysis Method"
abstract: >-
  An OWL 2 ontology for the Functional Resonance Analysis Method (FRAM),
  enabling formal representation of FRAM models as Linked Data. The ontology
  defines 59 classes and 129 properties (65 object + 64 datatype), 8 SHACL
  shapes, and a JSON-LD context, with a foundational alignment to gUFO
  (16 rdfs:subClassOf axioms). Distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
